User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/credit-cards\n?customerId&page&size
Controller -> Service : findAll(filter, page, size): Flowable<CreditCard>
Service -> Repo : findAll(filter, page, size)
Repo -> DB : SELECT ... ORDER BY createdAt, id\nLIMIT/OFFSET
DB --> Repo : tarjetas
Repo --> Service : Flowable<CreditCard>
Controller --> User : 200 OK\napplication/json (arreglo) o application/x-ndjson

